*   `[rbp - 24]` to `[rbp - 17]`: `_M_start` (8 bytes)
*   `[rbp - 16]` to `[rbp - 9]`: `_M_finish` (8 bytes)
*   `[rbp - 8]` to `[rbp - 1]`: `_M_end_of_storage` (8 bytes)

